# Baisa OS environment
#
# Persistence is optional. With NO Supabase vars set, the app runs on the
# dependency-free JSON store (great for local/dev and the Vercel preview demo).
# Set both vars below to switch to durable Supabase persistence — no code
# changes needed; the store auto-detects them.
#
# Apply supabase/migrations/0001_baisa_os.sql to your project first, then:

# SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key   # server-side only, never expose to the client
